{
    "background_story": "Frank was a thrill-seeking adventurer with a passion for flight. As a young man, he earned his pilot's license and spent years flying small planes across the country. But Frank's true love was wing-suited flying, where he could soar through the air like a bird. He spent countless hours perfecting his technique, studying wind patterns and aerodynamics. Frank's volant nature took him to new heights, literally, as he competed in international wing-suited flying competitions. His fearlessness and skill earned him the nickname 'The Flying Frank.' When not competing, Frank worked as a flight instructor, sharing his love of flight with others. His ultimate goal was to fly across the globe, exploring the world's most breathtaking landscapes from the air.",
